---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About this blog and its author" lang="en">
  <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
    <h1 class="font-pixel text-xl text-accent">About</h1>
    <p>
      Hi! I'm Parker. This is my technical blog, where I write about software development and
      the ups and downs of my career.
      <br /><br />
      In the age of AI, maybe a lot of people have given up on blogging. But AI's answers aren't
      always easy to understand, can be made up, and aren't always easy to verify. Since I already
      keep track of how I solve problems and what I think about my career, I might as well organize
      those notes and share them here.
      <br /><br />
      I also want to move my technical writing out of my
      <a href="https://www.parkerchang.life" class="text-accent">personal blog</a> so that site
      can stay focused on other things.
      <br /><br />
      For now, I'll mainly write notes to prepare for full-stack software engineering interviews
      and keep a record of my contributions to Apache Kafka.
      <br /><br />
      If I get too busy or my software career changes too much, I might stop updating this blog.
      I don't have any grand expectations for it; I'll just take things one step at a time.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><time datetime="2026-10-06T18:05:00+09:00">Last updated: 2026-10-06</time></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
